{"id":134799089327845,"type":"artist","name":"Eberhard Schoener","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":10,"info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/45b9c84f39fbda0c5ac68e794eebb3f2/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Eberhard Schoener (nacido el 13 de mayo, en 1938, Stuttgart) es un compositor, director, arreglista y teclista aleman.\n\nDe joven, Schoener viajó ampliamente por el Lejano Oriente y observó una amplia gama de prácticas religiosas, así como musicales. Esto dio lugar a una convicción de que todos los artistas deben abrazar a su propio patrimonio cultural, pero también estar abierto a otros. Su música hace referencia e incorpora una amplia gama de influencias e instrumentación","tags":["electronic","psychedelic","ambient","folk","world"]},"works":[{"id":253840313991573,"type":"album","name":"Destruction of Harmony","artist":"Eberhard Schoener","year":1971,"weight":3,"yt":"J00a7dGa8dE","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":41790883275694,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Moogsploitation","rank":104,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":228942976794246,"type":"album","name":"Meditation","artist":"Eberhard Schoener","year":1973,"weight":12,"yt":"2OzMGJLA11w","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":96,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":106284046011718,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Progressive Electronic","rank":188,"scaruffi":7.5}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":215346206626249,"type":"album","name":"Bali-Agúng","artist":"Eberhard Schoener","year":1976,"weight":3,"yt":"5Z0xO5ur9aw","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":71422834352820,"name":"RYM Top — Ambient — Ritual Ambient","rank":86,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":147234675471172,"type":"album","name":"Sky Music - Mountain Music","artist":"Eberhard Schoener","year":1984,"weight":4,"yt":"PUEaAjolt08